cable: the scenario ends in successful checkout and reaches the order confirmation.","by":{"kind":"ai","id":"design-agent"}},{"about":"sha256:b52925eb52b750df1d86020d465f063e6e9c235f342e861d0361d8b83e30aa65","rationale":"[applicability] Applicable: the successful confirmation in this scenario can show the order number.","by":{"kind":"ai","id":"design-agent"}},{"about":"sha256:b52925eb52b750df1d86020d465f063e6e9c235f342e861d0361d8b83e30aa65","rationale":"[applicability] Not applicable: this scenario covers an in-stock bouquet success path, not an out-of-stock refusal path.","by":{"kind":"ai","id":"design-agent"}},{"about":"sha256:b52925eb52b750df1d86020d465f063e6e9c235f342e861d0361d8b83e30aa65","rationale":"[applicability] Not applicable: this scenario selects an allowed delivery date and does not attempt the forbidden Sunday path.","by":{"kind":"ai","id":"design-agent"}},{"about":"sha256:b52925eb52b750df1d86020d465f063e6e9c235f342e861d0361d8b83e30aa65","rationale":"[applicability] Applicable: a successful order is the precondition for the order-email side effect promise.","by":{"kind":"ai","id":"design-agent"}},{"about":"sha256:b52925eb52b750df1d86020d465f063e6e9c235f342e861d0361d8b83e30aa65","rationale":"[applicability] Applicable: this scenario is explicitly the phone-surface happy path.","by":{"kind":"ai","id":"design-agent"}},{"about":"sha256:b52925eb52b750df1d86020d465f063e6e9c235f342e861d0361d8b83e30aa65","rationale":"[applicability] Not applicable: the scenario focuses on delivery-date refusal, not basket-total change after adding an in-stock bouquet.","by":{"kind":"ai","id":"design-agent"}},{"about":"sha256:b52925eb52b750df1d86020d465f063e6e9c235f342e861d0361d8b83e30aa65","rationale":"[applicability] Not applicable: the scenario does not proceed far enough to determine whether account creation is required before order submission.","by":{"kind":"ai","id":"design-agent"}},{"about":"sha256:b52925eb52b750df1d86020d465f063e6e9c235f342e861d0361d8b83e30aa65","ratio